            </note>
            <note corresp="#d460-f4" n="4" xml:id="d460-f4-content">
                <p>Secretary Dulles showed this message to President Eisenhower on July 16.
                    (Memorandum of conversation by Dulles; Eisenhower Library, Dulles Papers,
                    Meetings with the President)</p>
            </note>
